            <ArticleTitle>Do Cox-2 inhibitors have the potential to improve postoperative pain control?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>With the ever-developing role of nurses in pain management and the increasing responsibilities for nurse prescribers, it is important for nurses to be aware of the current evidence base for practice in this area. This article considers some of the latest research surrounding Cox-2 drugs and guidance on their use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
